#: html/pfappserver/root/src/views/Configuration/_components/TheSectionAdvancedAccessConfiguration.vue:10
msgid ""
"PacketFence allows you to create advanced filtering rules based on RADIUS, "
"DHCP, DNS or HTTP information. It also allows you to define advanced role-"
"mapping or VLAN-mapping rules."
